cobra kai's cast includes veterans from  the original films as well as a roster  of younger actors but how close are  their real-life ages to those of the  characters they portray  we've got the answers you're looking for  and some may surprise you  robert downey jr charlie sheen emilio  estevez and nicholas cage were all  reportedly considered for the role of  the karate kid himself daniel larusso  luckily for ralph macchio his  performance in francis ford coppola as  the outsiders left an impression on  casting director bonnie timmerman  and he got the nod for the karate kid  machio was a little older than the  aforementioned actors at 22 but his  babyface meant he was able to pull off  playing a high school student with ease  those youthful looks made it tricky to  land adult roles in the years that  followed but they've also allowed him to  remain recognizable as larusso  and that's not a bad thing the new  yorker's evergreen looks are why so many  people are double taking when they first  sit down to watch cobra kai  believe it or not he'll turn 60 in 2021  the year the third season premieres  the karate kid producers wanted an  unknown actor for the part of johnny  lawrence koberkai's top student  and daniel larusso's worst nightmare the  obnoxious ex-boyfriend of daniel's love  interest ally mills has developed into a  more sympathetic character since the  first film but back then he really was  the worst  in fact william zabka was so good at  making johnny unlikable that the live  audience brought in for the karate kids  final tournament scene actually started  booing him  with cobra kai zabko was given the  chance to redeem the character  something he's actually been doing in  person for over three decades  he told the new york post i'm older now  so i don't look exactly like the 18 year  old johnny but a lot of people would  come up to me over the years like  oh you're that jerk you're that bad guy  and i would defend johnny  the actor turns 55 in october 2020 and  he's definitely still got the moves  in the karate kid part 2 we learned that  daniel larusso's first love ally mills  had wrecked his car and run off with a  football player so it isn't all that  surprising that the character hasn't yet  been brought back for cobra kai  in her place is daniel larusso's  straight talking wife amanda larusso  portrayed by courtney hangler she was  actually on the verge of quitting acting  when she heard about the audition and  luckily for her her husband talked her  into going  before long she was rubbing shoulders  with the idols of her childhood  she told daily actor i met ralph macchio  at the screen test but that's all a blur  to me because i was terrified and then a  week later i got the phone call  you're moving to atlanta in three days  pack up your family there was no time to  even think  she admitted to feeling a bit like an  imposter to begin with though  considering she's supposed to be playing  a woman in her mid-40s that's  understandable  tangler was born in 1981 and she was  only 36 years old when the first season  of cobra kai premiered  martin cove beat out competition from  christopher walken kurt russell harvey  keitel jeff bridges and leonard nimoy  for the role of cobra kai sensei john  crease  an unhinged vietnam war vet and the  overarching villain of the franchise  to get in the right shape and the right  mindset cove shadowed choreographer and  real-life tournament referee pat  johnson who learned martial arts while  stationed in korea with the us army and  later worked with action star chuck  norris  cove picked up more than a couple of  techniques from his mentor  after spending some time in his company  the actor decided that johnson was so  much like crease that he essentially  just needed to mimic him  it seems to have worked as the actor  manages to be just as  if not more imposing in cobra kai  despite being in his golden years  i founded kobrakai  it belongs to me it always has  cove turned 74 in march 2020 but still  has multiple projects in various stages  of production and clearly doesn't plan  on slowing down  tanner buchanan was introduced to the  world of the karate kid by his mother  a black belt in the discipline and a  super fan of the movie buchanan never  got into martial arts himself as a child  but his skill set of gymnastics and  dance meant he was able to adapt to  koberkai's fight choreography with  relative ease  robbie keane is supposed to be an 18  year old in the show but buchanan was  older than that when the first episode  dropped  he turns 22 in december 2020 and with  his mixture of good looks athleticism  and acting chops will most likely be  around for years to come  jolo meridueno is best known as victor  from nbc's parenthood prior to landing  the part of 18 year old miguel miggy  diaz on cobra kai  miggy's neighbor on the show is william  zabka's johnny lawrence who molds the  teen into the top student at the dojo  it's clear from interviews that the  stars of the original movie franchise  have been going out of their way to make  the younger castmates feel at home  and if anyone needs an arm around his  shoulder it's maraduena unlike most of  the kids on the show he's actually  around the same age as his character  he was just 17 when the first season of  cobra kai premiered but despite his  tender years he's become one of the  show's standouts and a firm fan favorite  arkansas native mary mouser had never  seen the karate kid when she auditioned  for the part of samantha larusso  daughter of ralph macchio's daniel  larusso  when she landed the role she decided it  would be wise to familiarize herself  with her new on-screen father's  backstory  she told brief take i sat down with my  boyfriend and binge watched the movies  i loved them i ended up watching them  about five more times over filming the  course of the show  think i'm a bit of a fan girl the late  pat morita's mr miyagi struck a  particular chord with the young actor  reminding her of a mentor that she once  had she recalled  i had a great experience on a show i was  on called body of proof  i worked with desperate housewives star  dana delaney for three years and for the  duration of my 14 year old self to my 17  year old self and all the things i went  through in that period i consider her  family to me  by the time she was cast as 18 year old  samantha larusso on cobra kai she had  more than enough experience to handle  the demanding role  mouser turned 22 in may 2018 when the  first episode of the sequel series  dropped online  she can still pull off being a student  but she'll be in her mid-20s come the  end of 2021 when the third season of the  show is scheduled to air  jacob bertrand's eli moskowitz has been  on quite the roller coaster ride in the  first two seasons of cobra kai  after seeing miggy use his karate to  deal with multiple assailants eli  decides to join the cobra kai dojo so he  can learn the same techniques  but when he does the power ends up going  to his head he goes from being a bullied  kid to the one doing the bullying  an aspect of the character that the  actor really enjoys bertrand told  showbiz junkies  i think that it's harder for those kids  because they have so much aggression  from being bullied  they want payback hawk is very different  from the characters bertrand has played  in the past  the youngstar is used to being  recognized for his work in children's tv  but is now enjoying the fact that he has  some cross-generational appeal  he said at wondercon 2019 i did a lot of  like disney channel nickelodeon stuff  before cobra kai so my fan base was a  lot of younger like  12 year old girls and younger boys now  it's like 40 year old dudes who are like  dude you're so badass so i like that  aspect like my dad's era  being a 40 year old dude apparently  makes you an old man in bertrand's eyes  but that's because he's half that age  the affable actor celebrated his 20th  birthday in 2020.  one of the youngest cobra kai cast  members gianni dicenzo had not long  turned 16 when he auditioned for the  role of jaded social outcast dimitri  the third student to join daniel  larusso's revamped miyagi doe karate  dojo  like his co-star courtney hangler  dicenzo was cast very late in the game  and had to jump in at the deep end  he told cobra kai companion they had  sent me the script a couple of days  before the actual audition i went in and  literally two days later they called me  and said hey you're going to georgia  dimitri is 17 years old on the show so  dicenzo doesn't have to try too hard to  put himself in that high school mindset  his character starts out as a friend of  jacob bertrand's eli but when eli gets  in with the cobra kai lot and transforms  into vengeful bully talk they drift  apart  after a second ill-fated attempt at  joining cobra kai himself dimitri  decides that daniel larusso's teaching  methods are far more suited to him  when he finally faces hawk in season 2  he proves that he made the right choice  sending his ex-pal flying into a trophy  cabinet with a kick  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  you
 

